			"notes": "# This version includes all the features and fixes from the original CameraOverhaul 2.1.0\n\n## Added:\n- Mouse input smoothing feature\n- 'Sprinting' configuration context\n- `contextTransitionSmoothing` config option. Configuration contexts will now be smoothly blended between, preventing sudden snaps upon elytra/swimming/sprinting activation\n\n## Fixed:\n- Camera can move when the game is paused\n- Constant vertical camera shake on slime blocks"
		},
